      "problem": "Calling the shift \u2018surprising\u2019 anticipates the reader\u2019s reaction. Later, \u2018sings those words too\u2019 follows a sentence about confessing a fault and leaves the reader to decide whether the congregation sings a confession or the petition to see God\u2019s face. Jerome\u2019s Latin distinguishes the two.",
